{"caption":"","data":"theorem LeanProofs.zero_add : ∀ (n : Nat), 0 + n = n :=\nfun n =>\n  Nat.recAux (Eq.refl (0 + 0))\n    (fun k ih =>\n      Eq.mpr (id (congrArg (fun _a => _a = k + 1) (Nat.add_succ 0 k)))\n        (Eq.mpr (id (congrArg (fun _a => _a.succ = k + 1) ih)) (Eq.refl k.succ)))\n    n","endPos":{"column":6,"line":29},"fileName":"/home/aloza/lpx-work/AddZero.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":29},"severity":"information"}
